<title>POLAND: Polish NBP sells dollars at PLN 3.4855 - dealers.</title>
<headline>Polish NBP sells dollars at PLN 3.4855 - dealers.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland (NBP) again sold dollars on the interbank market, this time at 3.4855 zlotys, dealers said.</p>
<p>The intervention, described as &quot;large&quot;, came at 1210 GMT when the zloty was at 3.50 percent from the dollar parity rate for today -- the centre of the daily 14-percent trading band.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
